 ## Unreleased
 
+- `returns_credit` gives Greenway half the wholesale price per returned sandwich loaf, capped at 10% of loaves delivered that day.
 - Batch counts round partial batches up (25 units at batch size 12 gives 3 batches, not 2).
 - `load_catalog` rejects a batch size below 1 or a negative price, naming the product code.
 - `Product.has_allergen(name)` checks allergens case-insensitively.
